WEBVTT

00:00:01.390 --> 00:00:06.750
<i>The long-awaited day 
of the knights' ordination ceremony</i>

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:09.980
<i>took an unexpected turn 
when Inquisition warships attacked.</i>

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:14.950
<i>Under Queen Boudica's command, 
the Knights-sorcerers mobilized.</i>

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:20.590
<i>Meanwhile, leading the Inquisition's army 
were the Thaumaturges,</i>

00:00:20.590 --> 00:00:23.870
<i>Santori, Ullmina, and Verone.</i>

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:29.750
<i>The Inquisition had dispatched an 
unbelievably massive force just to fight Seth.</i>

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:35.050
<i>Maneuvering behind the scenes of this invasion 
were the Merchant Barons.</i>

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:39.620
<i>Their goal to make the sorcerers 
into slaves they could sell</i>

00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:44.640
<i>led them to approach the Inquisition 
and propose this plan,</i>

00:00:45.350 --> 00:00:50.690
<i>which uses the Harmonizium, 
a device with the power to nullify Fantasia.</i>

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:56.370
<i>The battle intensifies as many ideals, 
both just and evil, layer on top of each other.</i>

00:00:57.430 --> 00:01:00.880
<i>In the midst of it all, 
Lord de Gulis and some of his men</i>

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:03.830
<i>boarded the Merchant Barons' airship 
in order to form a secret pact,</i>

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:06.830
<i>but Baron Doussant's words shocked him.</i>

00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:13.170
<i>It turns out Mordred is 
Baron Doussant's son.</i>

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:27.180
Y-Your son?!

00:01:29.170 --> 00:01:30.980
You heard correctly.

00:01:31.490 --> 00:01:34.710
Mordred is my son by blood.

00:01:36.250 --> 00:01:40.100
Are these people associated 
with the Faithful of the Hermit?

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:42.120
Yes, Dad.

00:01:42.470 --> 00:01:44.610
Then we must give them a warm welcome.

00:01:45.190 --> 00:01:46.710
What's the meaning of this?

00:01:47.150 --> 00:01:51.130
But first, it seems 
we have another visitor.

00:03:28.970 --> 00:03:34.980
<b>The Light of Life Is Extinguished 
-Tragedy-</b>

00:03:31.170 --> 00:03:33.690
<i>"The Light of Life Is Extinguished."</i>

00:03:38.690 --> 00:03:39.900
Fire!

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:41.700
Fire!

00:03:42.810 --> 00:03:43.930
Your Majesty!

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:45.450
What is the situation?

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:47.630
It is as Ocoho reported.

00:03:47.630 --> 00:03:51.080
We are unable to use any magic 
in the vicinity of that machine.

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:56.090
Worse yet, its range has expanded 
as time has passed.

00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:59.340
If this continues, in another hour,

00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:02.590
all our weapons will be unusable!

00:04:03.150 --> 00:04:05.580
Is it possible to destroy that machine?

00:04:05.990 --> 00:04:07.770
Not with Fantasia.

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:09.850
And with our dragoons?

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:14.230
As you can see, 
an enormous Thaumaturge is protecting it.

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:16.180
If we can't rely on magic...

00:04:16.740 --> 00:04:20.640
To think we would be forced 
to fight the Inquisition without magic...

00:04:20.640 --> 00:04:22.110
It is unthinkable.

00:04:22.450 --> 00:04:23.470
But...

00:04:24.260 --> 00:04:26.190
In the name of the great Merlin,

00:04:26.190 --> 00:04:27.990
we cannot lose heart!

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:29.580
Ogmios!

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:34.720
Awaken, stone! 
Become this land's defender!

00:04:34.720 --> 00:04:36.540
Carreg!

00:04:37.140 --> 00:04:38.520
Wh-What's that?

00:04:38.520 --> 00:04:40.220
A-An earthquake?

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:49.790
G-Golems!

00:04:53.970 --> 00:04:55.660
All right, now!

00:04:55.660 --> 00:04:56.580
Right!

00:04:57.130 --> 00:04:59.170
<i>The stone guardians have awakened.</i>

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:02.180
<i>Even the queen can't keep this up for long.</i>

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:07.020
Dragoons, let's move!

00:05:07.020 --> 00:05:11.330
Take the enemy's weapons 
before we lose the ability to use Fantasia!

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:12.330
Yes, sir!

00:05:18.850 --> 00:05:20.590
How delightful!

00:05:20.970 --> 00:05:25.250
Some giant puppets are coming this way.

00:05:25.250 --> 00:05:27.340
How very barbaric.

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:29.510
This is not good.

00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:34.670
Those golems can't be destroyed 
with normal weapons.

00:05:35.290 --> 00:05:36.710
I'm going to help them.

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:42.730
What a sharp mind that boy has!

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:46.360
The prince is the youngest 
of the Thaumaturges.

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:48.490
He is the chosen child.

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:52.550
Well, now, let us see what he can do.

00:06:00.950 --> 00:06:02.350
O-Our weapons!

00:06:02.850 --> 00:06:04.380
Stop him!

00:06:05.650 --> 00:06:08.380
You people have made two mistakes.

00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:13.260
The first was setting foot in Cyfandir.

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:15.770
And the second is...

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:15.270
Get him!

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:17.910
The second is...

00:06:19.140 --> 00:06:21.020
Fools!

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:24.260
Don't make me repeat myself!

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:30.160
All right!

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:32.160
All forces, advance!

00:06:37.390 --> 00:06:38.590
What is that sound?

00:06:41.450 --> 00:06:43.540
The stone guardians!

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:02.290
A-A child?

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:04.740
Who cares?! Forward!

00:07:04.740 --> 00:07:05.570
Yeah!

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:06.440
W-Wait!

00:07:06.980 --> 00:07:11.700
O Father of the Inquisition, 
founder of miracles...

00:07:12.090 --> 00:07:16.410
Grant eternal silence 
to these impure ones.

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:35.710
D-Darn it!

00:07:35.710 --> 00:07:36.750
That won't work.

00:07:37.180 --> 00:07:39.930
It's woven out of black silver.

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:41.890
Mordred!

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:44.190
Ocoho, why did you come here?

00:07:44.500 --> 00:07:47.660
Ocoho's been investigating us 
for a long time.

00:07:47.660 --> 00:07:52.330
She did mistakenly think that 
our leader was the queen, though.

00:07:52.940 --> 00:07:56.240
Are you saying the queen 
has no connection to us?!

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:57.510
Of course.

00:07:57.510 --> 00:08:00.780
Then... whom are we loyal to?

00:08:00.780 --> 00:08:03.850
"I will not divide this land."

00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:05.960
Convenient words, aren't they?

00:08:06.410 --> 00:08:09.210
And the queen is the clincher.

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:11.970
Saying that she was the one 
pulling the strings

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:14.470
was such an easy way 
to fool all of you.

00:08:15.690 --> 00:08:20.730
We were merely trying to punish those 
who betrayed the great Merlin!

00:08:20.730 --> 00:08:23.980
So we were only helping 
the enemy invade?!

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:26.130
Why did you guys get involved

00:08:26.130 --> 00:08:29.480
with that nasty 
Faithful of the Hermit gang, anyway?!

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:33.830
For profit, of course, young lady.

00:08:33.830 --> 00:08:35.240
Profit?

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:37.530
In order for us to profit,

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:43.280
it was necessary to earn the trust 
of this land's citizens.

00:08:43.280 --> 00:08:48.000
The people of Cyfandir would 
never trust the likes of you!

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:50.410
Are you certain about that?

00:08:50.410 --> 00:08:52.030
Wh-What are you saying?

00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:53.970
The Knights-sorcerers sympathize with

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:57.030
and encourage the people 
affected by the Spectre Nemesis,

00:08:57.030 --> 00:09:02.350
but they have taken no significant 
measures to help them.

00:09:02.350 --> 00:09:04.020
That is...

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:09.860
We, on the other hand, gave them 
substantial quantities

00:09:09.860 --> 00:09:15.110
of money and labor to save
 the farmlands that you destroyed.

00:09:15.110 --> 00:09:18.330
Wounded and fearful that they would starve,

00:09:18.330 --> 00:09:22.120
they gladly accepted our outstretched hand.

00:09:22.670 --> 00:09:27.620
Of course, I doubt that would have been enough 
to prompt the Inquisition to act.

00:09:28.140 --> 00:09:32.150
We have the horned sorcerer 
to thank for that.

00:09:32.150 --> 00:09:34.650
Do you mean... Seth?

00:09:34.650 --> 00:09:36.200
He isn't the only one.

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:37.260
There's Diabal, too.

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:42.390
The horned sorcerer said to dwell 
beneath the castle.

00:09:42.390 --> 00:09:45.780
He is an international criminal.

00:09:45.780 --> 00:09:46.460
What—

00:09:46.460 --> 00:09:47.640
Diabal's a criminal?!

00:09:47.640 --> 00:09:51.380
Oh? It appears you were unaware.

00:09:51.380 --> 00:09:55.900
Well, in truth, he is not directly 
responsible for said crimes.

00:09:56.350 --> 00:09:59.640
But to get General Torque on our side

00:09:59.640 --> 00:10:02.300
and persuade the Inquisition to intervene,

00:10:02.300 --> 00:10:05.910
he was exactly what we needed.

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:13.420
As a result, we succeeded 
in securing a tidy profit.

00:10:13.420 --> 00:10:17.300
We will never give in to the Inquisition!

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:18.520
This land—

00:10:18.520 --> 00:10:22.310
This land was not our only objective.

00:10:22.310 --> 00:10:24.310
Wh-What?

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:26.560
The infected.

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:32.060
This war was started in order to make slaves 
of all the infected in this land.

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:34.320
Slaves?!

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:41.030
This war has brought pain and suffering 
to many innocent civilians.

00:10:41.030 --> 00:10:44.330
It was the infected 
who made this tragedy possible.

00:10:45.130 --> 00:10:47.780
You know how the world wants 
to deal with those dangerous,

00:10:47.780 --> 00:10:51.860
tyrannical infected people, don't you?

00:10:51.860 --> 00:10:53.590
Th-That's...

00:10:56.110 --> 00:11:01.840
You Faithful of the Hermit 
truly did a wonderful job for us!

00:11:02.210 --> 00:11:05.470
I cannot thank you enough.

00:11:06.770 --> 00:11:08.360
Not to worry.

00:11:08.360 --> 00:11:12.230
We will save the citizens 
who have been oppressed by this war.

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:14.620
You need not think about anything,

00:11:14.620 --> 00:11:18.290
but simply become our property.

00:11:18.290 --> 00:11:23.890
B-But there's no way 
you can make sorcerers into slaves!

00:11:23.890 --> 00:11:25.010
Sure there is.

00:11:26.220 --> 00:11:28.740
As long as we have the machine 
that nullifies Fantasia.

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:31.870
You saw how powerful it is.

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:33.960
A device that negates Fantasia

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:36.440
and an army of Inquisitors...

00:11:36.440 --> 00:11:38.130
This country is done for.

00:11:38.970 --> 00:11:41.010
Regardless of how this war ends,

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:43.260
the fate of the infected is sealed.

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:46.380
There is no need for any further bloodshed.

00:11:46.380 --> 00:11:48.810
It would be best for you 
to surrender right now.

00:11:49.770 --> 00:11:52.020
Are you actually serious?!

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:55.170
Those guys talked you into this, right?!

00:11:55.870 --> 00:12:01.280
Ocoho, I have lived my whole life for this day.

00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:04.740
Since long before I met you two.

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:07.830
Mordred...

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:14.960
<b>[Childhood of Ocoho and Her Friends] 
Memories of the good old days. 
They seem like an illusion now...</b>

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:32.330
Sciath!

00:12:37.730 --> 00:12:38.980
Our comrades!

00:12:43.980 --> 00:12:45.470
Your Majesty!

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:48.410
Your Majesty, please rest for a bit!

00:12:48.800 --> 00:12:51.170
My retainers are dying.

00:12:51.590 --> 00:12:55.400
And you want me 
 to just sit by and watch?

00:12:55.400 --> 00:12:57.650
You've done more than enough!

00:12:57.650 --> 00:12:58.660
No.

00:12:59.140 --> 00:13:01.550
After allowing so many 
to be sacrificed...

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:05.550
I cannot possibly have done enough!

00:13:08.900 --> 00:13:09.870
Your Majesty!

00:13:09.870 --> 00:13:11.190
You mustn't!

00:13:20.130 --> 00:13:21.070
What?!

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:23.250
The queen's charging at us alone!

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:24.850
What a dumb woman!

00:13:24.850 --> 00:13:26.030
Shoot her!

00:13:40.180 --> 00:13:43.210
So the giant queen makes
 her appearance, eh?

00:13:43.210 --> 00:13:47.090
At last, an opponent with some backbone!

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:48.470
Fire!

00:13:49.430 --> 00:13:51.220
For Bome!

00:13:54.910 --> 00:13:57.410
Where is that woman trying to go?

00:13:57.410 --> 00:13:59.230
She's just on a desperate dash!

00:13:59.230 --> 00:14:00.730
Shoot her!

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:04.030
Sh-She's not stopping!

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:05.230
Relax!

00:14:05.230 --> 00:14:08.930
She'll soon enter the Fantasia-negation zone.

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:11.350
Prepare to capture her!

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:20.630
Y-Your Majesty!

00:14:24.250 --> 00:14:25.750
You have to stop, Your Majesty!

00:14:25.750 --> 00:14:28.510
You'll soon lose the ability 
to use Fantasia!

00:14:30.390 --> 00:14:31.460
Your Majesty!

00:14:31.460 --> 00:14:33.510
Your Majesty!

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:35.520
Now! Capture her!

00:14:50.130 --> 00:14:52.160
Queen Boudica...

00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:57.040
I have long dreamed of fighting you.

00:14:58.050 --> 00:15:02.970
Would you rather be trampled 
or thrown high into the sky?

00:15:02.970 --> 00:15:05.210
I had such high hopes for you.

00:15:05.210 --> 00:15:08.540
To think you've been reduced
 to this state by a mere love tap...

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:11.550
Frankly, I'm disappointed.

00:15:11.550 --> 00:15:15.790
You were just running blindly forward.

00:15:15.790 --> 00:15:19.630
That puts you beneath those golems 
you set on us earlier.

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:24.070
I swear on my beard...

00:15:24.070 --> 00:15:26.590
With a foolish queen like you,

00:15:26.590 --> 00:15:30.570
this country was bound to fall sooner or later.

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:38.080
That's the spirit!

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:41.960
Now, great queen of Caislean Merlin,

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:45.750
entertain me a bit longer!

00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:03.230
The machine!

00:16:05.910 --> 00:16:08.230
Th-The Fantasia is back!

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:10.900
Now! Attack!

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:26.580
Was your goal to break 
the Fantasia-nullifying device all along?

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:28.590
How dare you?!

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:34.840
You should be dead, you lowly infected!

00:16:42.790 --> 00:16:44.660
I suppose it's all right.

00:16:44.660 --> 00:16:48.110
The device isn't completely destroyed.

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:52.240
It seems to have only stopped temporarily.

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:54.930
Now that I've captured the queen,

00:16:54.930 --> 00:16:59.590
I swear on my beard 
that our victory is assured.

00:16:59.590 --> 00:17:01.120
However...

00:17:01.820 --> 00:17:05.370
This is not nearly enough for me!

00:17:06.050 --> 00:17:11.590
Horned sorcerer, 
I suggest you quickly find your way to me

00:17:11.590 --> 00:17:14.880
and quench this thirst of mine!

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:20.640
If you do not, I will squash you 
along with this entire country!

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:25.140
It appears the queen has been captured.

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:26.050
What?!

00:17:26.050 --> 00:17:27.470
N-No!

00:17:27.470 --> 00:17:28.610
We must save her!

00:17:28.610 --> 00:17:31.890
That does not sound 
like a very good plan.

00:17:31.890 --> 00:17:33.610
Excuse me?

00:17:33.610 --> 00:17:36.680
This country is already finished.

00:17:36.680 --> 00:17:40.740
You lot should be giving 
more thought to your own safety.

00:17:40.740 --> 00:17:42.370
Why, you...

00:17:43.670 --> 00:17:45.350
Worry not.

00:17:45.350 --> 00:17:47.120
You are heroes.

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:52.410
Allow us to warmly welcome you 
into our ranks.

00:17:53.590 --> 00:17:55.010
Enough of your insolence!

00:17:55.370 --> 00:17:58.250
We are proud Knights-sorcerers!

00:17:59.300 --> 00:18:02.640
I suppose our negotiations 
have broken down.

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:07.640
Take this!

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:09.100
Not bad!

00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:10.690
You ain't seen nothin' yet!

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:12.250
Lord de Gulis!

00:18:17.650 --> 00:18:20.160
I guess our negotiations
have broken down, too.

00:18:20.690 --> 00:18:23.210
What negotiations are you talking about?!

00:18:23.210 --> 00:18:25.040
Wake up, Mordred!

00:18:25.410 --> 00:18:27.430
But I'm not asleep.

00:18:27.430 --> 00:18:32.360
I've lived my life 
in anticipation of this moment,

00:18:32.360 --> 00:18:34.300
ever since I was a child.

00:18:34.300 --> 00:18:37.800
But haven't we been friends 
ever since we were little?

00:18:38.510 --> 00:18:40.780
Was that all just an act, too?!

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:44.310
I was playing the role of your friend.

00:18:45.450 --> 00:18:48.070
It wasn't difficult for me to do at all.

00:18:48.670 --> 00:18:50.190
Mordred...

00:18:50.190 --> 00:18:54.320
I've kept up the act, because I felt 
it was the most efficient way. That's all.

00:18:54.740 --> 00:18:58.650
That includes the time after 
we joined the Faithful of the Hermit.

00:18:58.650 --> 00:19:02.320
You'd do all that just to earn
 the favor of a father like him?!

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:06.630
I merely follow my father's orders. 
Nothing more.

00:19:06.630 --> 00:19:09.080
That's how all this was designed to be.

00:19:09.430 --> 00:19:12.530
But none of that even matters.

00:19:13.100 --> 00:19:14.880
I'm empty, you see.

00:19:15.190 --> 00:19:17.390
Then I'll make you understand

00:19:17.390 --> 00:19:20.840
what's important and what's wrong!

00:19:20.840 --> 00:19:23.710
That's so like you, Sagramore.

00:19:23.710 --> 00:19:25.640
But it won't work.

00:19:25.640 --> 00:19:28.730
You simply don't have it in you.

00:19:29.070 --> 00:19:30.350
Still!

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:34.060
Your calm, collected nature was
 the only thing you had going for you.

00:19:34.060 --> 00:19:37.700
Getting so emotional
 will only dull your strikes.

00:19:38.170 --> 00:19:41.110
We'll continue this... 
after I apprehend you!

00:19:41.480 --> 00:19:42.850
If you can.

00:19:54.410 --> 00:19:56.620
You have a funny face, 
but you're pretty good!

00:19:56.620 --> 00:19:59.880
It's a true shame that 
you're a lowly Knight-sorcerer!

00:20:00.900 --> 00:20:04.220
You have a funny face as well, 
but your skill is quite real!

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:07.390
Still, you're no more than a foolish clown!

00:20:07.390 --> 00:20:09.360
What did you say, infected?!

00:20:09.360 --> 00:20:10.890
Got a problem, clown?! Huh?!

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:21.620
I'm telling you that
 if you shut up and become a slave,

00:20:21.620 --> 00:20:23.280
I'll spare you, you bumpkin!

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:26.770
And who would willingly become a slave?!

00:20:26.770 --> 00:20:28.300
You're mistaken!

00:20:28.300 --> 00:20:33.540
We may call you a slave, but we'll generously 
take you in and keep you safe!

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:35.780
You dare speak of keeping me "safe"?!

00:20:35.780 --> 00:20:38.930
How self-serving can you people be?!

00:20:39.970 --> 00:20:42.500
Just listen to me, you stubborn fool!

00:20:42.500 --> 00:20:44.130
That's my line!

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:49.450
You will regret mocking a
 Knight-sorcerer of Caislean Merlin!

00:20:50.050 --> 00:20:53.810
Finishing move: Rainbow Impact!

00:20:53.810 --> 00:20:55.490
How dare you?! Take this!

00:20:55.490 --> 00:20:58.310
Needle Rain!

00:20:58.530 --> 00:21:00.330
Kaboom!

00:21:00.860 --> 00:21:05.020
Curses!

00:21:15.850 --> 00:21:17.080
Glaw!

00:21:15.850 --> 00:21:17.080
Sciath!

00:21:45.340 --> 00:21:48.030
Mordred... please...

00:21:49.110 --> 00:21:49.820
Let's just...

00:21:52.980 --> 00:21:54.210
Sagramore...

00:21:54.790 --> 00:21:57.250
You seem ruthless at a glance, 
but in truth,

00:21:57.670 --> 00:22:00.860
you care deeply for your friends.

00:22:08.410 --> 00:22:12.450
I always thought that made you naïve.

00:22:16.620 --> 00:22:18.980
N-No...

00:22:19.350 --> 00:22:24.980
No!

00:22:24.980 --> 00:22:29.990
To Be Continued

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:20.700
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:01.050 --> 00:24:04.400
<i>General Torque's goal is to capture Seth,</i>

00:24:04.400 --> 00:24:06.300
<i>not to fight a war.</i>

00:24:06.830 --> 00:24:10.670
<i>Dragunov believed his words 
without the slightest doubt.</i>

00:24:11.290 --> 00:24:15.010
<i>Seth, sharing this desire to end the war,</i>

00:24:15.010 --> 00:24:17.530
<i>agrees to follow Dragunov.</i>

00:24:17.530 --> 00:24:19.170
<i>However...</i>

00:24:20.020 --> 00:24:24.180
<i>Next time on <i>Radiant</i>, 
"The Black Dragon Descends."</i>

00:24:20.700 --> 00:24:25.020
<b>The Black Dragon Descends 
-Pen Draig-</b>

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:30.250
<b>End</b>
